target="_blank" href="https://opra.cboe.com/">Login</a></li></ul></nav></section></header><main><div class="tw-mb-7 tw-bg-blue-950 tw-bg-hero-pattern tw-bg-cover tw-px-4 tw-py-12"><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-my-10 tw-flex tw-max-w-7xl tw-flex-col md:tw-flex-row"><div class="tw-mb-3"><div class="tw-flex tw-mb-5"><div class="tw-mr-5 tw-h-3 tw-w-3 tw-rounded-full tw-bg-white"></div><div class="tw-mr-5 tw-h-3 tw-w-3 tw-rounded-full tw-bg-white"></div><div class="tw-mr-5 tw-h-3 tw-w-3 tw-rounded-full tw-bg-white"></div></div><h1 class="tw-mb-5 tw-font-semi-bold tw-text-6xl tw-text-white">Welcome to OPRA</h1><h2 class="tw-text-2xl tw-text-white">Options Price Reporting Authority</h2></div><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-my-5 md:tw-mr-2"><div class="tw-mb-4 tw-flex tw-w-64 tw-justify-center tw-rounded tw-bg-opra-purple-light tw-p-4 tw-text-white tw-transition tw-duration-100 tw-ease-in-out hover:tw-scale-105 hover:tw-cursor-pointer hover:tw-bg-opra-purple-medium"><a href="https://www.payerexpress.com/ebp/opra/" class="tw-text-sm tw-uppercase tw-no-underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pay Opra Invoices</a></div><div class="tw-mb-4 tw-flex tw-w-64 tw-justify-center tw-rounded tw-bg-opra-purple-light tw-p-4 tw-text-white tw-transition tw-duration-100 tw-ease-in-out hover:tw-scale-105 hover:tw-cursor-pointer hover:tw-bg-opra-purple-medium"><a href="https://opraplan.my.site.com/s/" class="tw-text-sm tw-uppercase tw-no-underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Reporting Portal Login</a></div></div></div><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-flex tw-max-w-7xl tw-flex-col md:tw-flex-row"><p class="tw-text-l tw-text-white">The Options Price Reporting Authority (OPRA) disseminates consolidated last sale and quotation information originating from the national securities exchanges that have been approved by the Securities and Exchange Commission to provide markets for the listing and trading of exchange-traded securities options.</p></div></div><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-mb-36 tw-max-w-[1230px] tw-px-4"><h2 class="tw-mb-8 tw-border-b tw-border-gray-300 tw-pb-8 tw-text-lg tw-font-medium tw-text-opra-purple-dark lg:tw-text-2xl">Overview</h2><h3 class="tw-mb-3 tw-text-lg tw-font-medium tw-text-opra-purple-dark lg:tw-text-2xl">Getting Started</h3><a class="tw-pl-3 tw-text-lg tw-text-blue-600 tw-decoration-2" href="#email_alerts_sign_up">Sign Up for OPRA Email Alerts</a><div class="tw-relative tw-m-3"><div class="tw-relative tw-top-px tw-flex tw-overflow-x-auto tw-overflow-y-hidden"><button class=" tw-mr-3 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-rounded-t tw-border-x tw-border-t tw-border-solid tw-border-slate-300 tw-border-b-white hover:tw-bg-slate-200 tw-px-6 tw-py-4 tw-text-left tw-uppercase  tw-text-blue-800  tw-font-bold tw-border-b-2">Announcements</button><button class=" tw-mr-3 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-rounded-t tw-border-x tw-border-t tw-border-solid tw-border-slate-300 tw-border-b-white hover:tw-bg-slate-200 tw-px-6 tw-py-4 tw-text-left tw-uppercase  tw-text-blue-800  ">Alerts</button><button class=" tw-mr-3 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-rounded-t tw-border-x tw-border-t tw-border-solid tw-border-slate-300 tw-border-b-white hover:tw-bg-slate-200 tw-px-6 tw-py-4 tw-text-left tw-uppercase  tw-text-blue-800  ">OPRA Overview</button><button class=" tw-mr-3 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-rounded-t tw-border-x tw-border-t tw-border-solid tw-border-slate-300 tw-border-b-white hover:tw-bg-slate-200 tw-px-6 tw-py-4 tw-text-left tw-uppercase  tw-text-blue-800  ">Become a Vendor</button><button class=" tw-mr-3 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-rounded-t tw-border-x tw-border-t tw-border-solid tw-border-slate-300 tw-border-b-white hover:tw-bg-slate-200 tw-px-6 tw-py-4 tw-text-left tw-uppercase  tw-text-blue-800  ">Find Vendor</button></div><div class="tw-rounded-b tw-rounded-tr  tw-py-4 tw-border tw-border-solid  tw-border-slate-300 tw-px-6 tw-py-2 tw-visible"><div class="tw-mb-12"><div class="tw-relative tw-m-3"><div class="tw-relative tw-top-px tw-flex tw-overflow-x-auto tw-overflow-